One related kill chain on csoh.org, and the page's related defense topics.

The page links the Shai-Hulud kill chain in its summary. Elastic links this campaign to the earlier Shai-Hulud attacks through similarities and Dune-themed strings, and names no actor. The exfiltration repositories' description, Shai-Hulud: Here We Go Again, is the family marker stage 07 names.

The four defense topics the page links are CI/CD security, GitHub Actions security, detection engineering and incident response. CI/CD stands for continuous integration and continuous delivery.
